# Imperial Tactician Design System

Apply when building or styling UI for this Civilization V companion app (Expo, React Native, NativeWind).

## Visual Identity

- **Tone:** Historical, strategic, authoritative — modernized parchment, royal accents, serif headings.
- **Palette** (prefer Tailwind theme tokens in `tailwind.config.js`; use hex when tokens are missing):

| Token | Hex | Usage |
|-------|-----|--------|
| `surface` | `#fff8f5` | Screen/card parchment background |
| `primary` | `#002b5b` | Imperial Blue — headers, emphasis |
| `secondary` | `#b08d57` | Antique Gold — selection accents, highlights |
| `outline` | `#e1d8d4` | Borders, dividers (Parchment Dim) |
| `on-surface-variant` | — | Muted body copy on parchment (define in theme; italic descriptions) |

```tsx
// ✅ Card on parchment surface
<View className="rounded-md border border-outline bg-surface shadow-sm" />

// ❌ Generic white/gray shells unrelated to the palette
<View className="bg-white dark:bg-neutral-950" />
```

## Typography

- **Headlines:** `Bodoni Moda` (`font-serif`) for civilization names, screen headers, and top-bar branding.
- **Body/labels:** System sans-serif for body copy, captions, and dense mobile UI.
- **Hierarchy:** Strong contrast — serif headings over utility sans text; avoid mixing decorative serifs in long body blocks.

## Civilization Library — Card States & Selection

### Default State

- Solid parchment background (`bg-surface`, `#fff8f5`).
- Subtle grain texture overlay (low-opacity SVG noise; must not reduce legibility).
- `1px` border (`border border-outline`, `#e1d8d4`).
- `shadow-sm`, `rounded-md`.

```tsx
<ImperialCard className="border border-outline bg-surface shadow-sm">
  {/* collapsed header */}
</ImperialCard>
```

### Expanded / Selected State

- **Border:** `3px`–`4px` Antique Gold (`border-secondary`, `#b08d57`) on the **leading edge (left)** or as a full border.
- **Elevation:** `shadow-md` so the card reads as layered above neighbors.
- **Background:** Remain parchment (`bg-surface`); do **not** invert to `bg-primary` for selection.
- **Content:** Reveal the detailed section below the leader/civ header.

```tsx
<ImperialCard className="border-l-4 border-l-secondary border border-outline bg-surface shadow-md">
  {/* header + CivilizationExpandedDetails */}
</ImperialCard>
```

## Civilization Library — Detailed View Layout

Apply inside the expanded card (`p-4` or `p-6`; outer list uses `px-margin-mobile`).

### Leader Header

| Element | Style |
|---------|--------|
| Subtitle | Leader name, **all-caps**, `text-primary`, small size |
| Title | Civilization name, `font-serif` (Bodoni Moda), larger, `text-primary` |
| Icon | 40×40px civilization emblem, top-right |

### Description

- Short italic paragraph with historical context.
- `text-on-surface-variant` (muted on parchment).

### Strategic Section

- **Divider:** Subtle horizontal rule (`bg-outline` / `#e1d8d4`).
- **Special ability:** Heading — `text-primary`, bold, all-caps — then ability description.
- **Unique assets:** Two-column grid — **UNIQUE UNITS** | **UNIQUE BUILDINGS** — bulleted lists, small label text.

### Primary Action (expanded only)

- Full-width button at bottom of expanded content.
- **High emphasis:** `bg-primary` (`#002b5b`), white text, label **"VIEW MORE HISTORY"**.

```tsx
<Pressable className="w-full rounded-md bg-primary py-3">
  <Text className="text-center font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-white">
    View more history
  </Text>
</Pressable>
```

## Components & Layout

- **Cards:** Default per **Card States** above; all cards use parchment `#fff8f5`, not plain white/gray.
- **Buttons:**
  - **Primary (screen-level):** `bg-secondary` (`#b08d57`) with dark text (`text-primary` or near-black).
  - **Secondary:** Outlined / low emphasis (e.g. “Decline & Skip”) — `border-outline`, parchment or transparent fill.
  - **Detail CTA:** `bg-primary` + white text (see **Primary Action** above).
- **Navigation:**
  - **Top bar:** Fixed, clear serif app title/branding in Imperial Blue.
  - **Bottom nav:** 4 destinations; container `rounded-t-full`, `bg-surface` or dimmed parchment variant.
- **Spacing:** `px-margin-mobile` for screen/card containers; `p-4` or `p-6` inside expanded details.

## Refined Styling

- **Parchment texture:** Low-opacity SVG grain or noise overlay on card backgrounds; keep opacity low enough for readable text.
- **Surfaces:** Cards and list rows always `bg-surface` (`#fff8f5`).

## Icons & Framework

- **Icons:** Material Symbols **outlined** for utility nav (Library, Military Tech, History, Leaderboard). Do not introduce new icon families for these patterns.
- **Styling:** NativeWind `className` on React Native primitives; extend `tailwind.config.js` rather than hard-coding one-off colors in screens.
- **Pills / nav chips:** `rounded-full` for interactive navigation pills.

## Checklist Before Shipping UI

1. Surfaces use parchment (`#fff8f5`), not plain white/gray defaults.
2. Collapsed cards: 1px `outline` border, optional grain, `shadow-sm`.
3. Expanded cards: Antique Gold leading/full border (3–4px), `shadow-md`, parchment background retained.
4. Detail layout: leader subtitle (caps), serif civ title, emblem, italic description, strategic grid, Imperial Blue CTA.
5. Screen-level actions use Antique Gold; expanded **View more history** uses Imperial Blue + white.
6. Titles use Bodoni Moda; supporting text uses sans-serif.
7. Cards and nav match shadow, border, and rounding patterns above.
